.page zcat 1 print compressed files

# SYNOPSIS
*zcat* [_FILE_...]

# DESCRIPTION
`zcat` decompresses each gzip _FILE_ to standard output and leaves the files alone; it is *gzip -dc*. With no _FILE_ it reads standard input.

# EXAMPLES
    zcat notes.txt.gz | wc -l
    tar -cf - /Hakurei/etc | gzip | zcat | tar -tf -

# SEE ALSO
gzip(1)
